WEBVTT

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:30.808
Haven't even mentioned NFT or Web3,

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:33.227
but these hopefully
will become the infrastructure

00:04:33.227 --> 00:04:35.146
that drives this going forward.

00:04:35.646 --> 00:04:38.983
So if you're wondering
what the metaverse looks like,

00:04:39.025 --> 00:04:40.151
this is it.

00:04:42.153 --> 00:04:43.946
The reason games are so successful

00:04:43.946 --> 00:04:47.450
is because they provide
a deep sense of engagement,

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:49.201
community and purpose.

00:04:49.201 --> 00:04:52.663
Yes, we use them to escape
and to entertain, and that’s OK.

00:04:52.663 --> 00:04:54.123
But at their best,

00:04:54.123 --> 00:04:57.752
they speak to some of our primal
social and psychological needs,

00:04:57.793 --> 00:05:01.047
from feeling effective
to achieving our goals,